deep item crafting system, player-driven economy, and persistent, community-built worlds. LumaWorlds blends creative freedom, social trading, and collaborative world-building.<br></p>\r\n<p>Players can unleash their creativity by designing a custom world, whether a challenging parkour course, a rare item shop, or a beautiful landscape to share with everyone. Bringing these creations to life requires gathering resources, crafting a vast array of items including stylish clothing, and mastering the art of social trading. For players who are seeking a different kind of thrill, special challenge worlds await, offering cooperative challenges.<br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_484253\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"01 September 2026 @ 15:58 UTC\"><span class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> 1 day ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-android\">Android</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div item